<div>
  <p>@Model.FirstName,</p>
  
  <p>
      We regret to inform you that your refund request for @Model.RequestAmount has been denied by @Model.ProviderAccountName.
  </p>

  <p>
    Reason: <br />
    @Model.DeniedReason
  </p>

  <p>
    If you have any questions or concerns, please contact @Model.ProviderAccountName directly. If you need to dispute this claim, please contact @Model.ProductName Support via email at <a href="mailto:@Model.SupportEmail">@Model.SupportEmail</a>.
  </p>
  
  <p>
    Your @Model.ProductName Team
  </p>
</div>